---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="2026 版本控制工具图景 · 交互展示">
  <div class="vcs-page">
    <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
    <nav class="vcs-top-nav">
      <div class="nav-container">
        <a href="/explore-more" class="nav-back">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>返回探索更多</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-center-tag">
          <span class="pulse-indicator"></span>
          <span>TECH RADAR · 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/golden-time" class="nav-pill">数字与黄金</a>
          <a href="/ace" class="nav-pill">Ace 看板</a>
          <a href="/profile" class="nav-pill">个人主页</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">

      <header class="hero">
        <div class="eyebrow">VERSION CONTROL · 2026</div>
        <h1>谁将接替 Git？——版本控制工具图景</h1>
        <p>每个项目一张卡片：定位、许可证、现状，以及一个核心概念的小动画。排序规则：开源项目按"接替 Git 的可能性"从高到低；非开源但个人可免费使用的排在其后；完全拿不到的大厂系统与开源平替对照展示。数据核查于 2026 年 10 月。</p>
        <div class="legend">
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot g"></span>开源</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot a"></span>非完全开源 / 个人免费</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot r"></span>大厂内部 · 不可获取</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- ============ A 组：开源梯队 ============ -->
      <section class="group">
        <div class="group-title"><h2>A · 开源梯队</h2><span>按接替 Git 的可能性排序</span></div>
        <p class="group-desc">许可证干净、可直接上手。越靠前，越可能成为"后 Git 时代"的日常工具。</p>

        <!-- 1. Jujutsu -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">1</span>Jujutsu（jj）<span class="badge oss">Apache-2.0 · 开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">Git 兼容的下一代 VCS——Git 只做它的存储后端</p>
            <ul>
              <li><b>Change ID</b>：改写提交（amend/rebase）后身份不变，审查与讨论不失联</li>
              <li><code>jj op log</code> 记录每一次仓库操作，<code>jj evolog</code> 回看改动演变——AI 时代"谁动了什么"一目了然</li>
              <li>v0.46.0（2026-10），月度发版，社区最活跃</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://github.com/jj-vcs/jj" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/jj-vcs/jj</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <rect class="n" x="30" y="20" width="110" height="34" rx="8"/>
              <text class="lbl jj-h1" x="85" y="41" text-anchor="middle">commit a1b2c3</text>
              <text class="lbl jj-h2" x="85" y="41" text-anchor="middle" fill="#2563eb">commit d4e5f6</text>
              <text class="sub" x="85" y="70" text-anchor="middle">amend / rebase 改写</text>
              <line class="edge" x1="85" y1="54" x2="85" y2="82"/>
              <rect x="30" y="84" width="110" height="30" rx="8" fill="#dbeafe" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="85" y="103" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1d4ed8">Change ID: kqyz…（不变）</text>
              <text class="sub" x="200" y="45" text-anchor="start">哈希会变</text>
              <text class="sub" x="200" y="100" text-anchor="start" fill="#1d4ed8">身份不变</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：Change ID 跨改写稳定</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Sapling -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">2</span>Sapling<span class="badge oss">MIT · 开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">Meta 出品，为超大仓库而生的 Git 兼容客户端</p>
            <ul>
              <li><code>sl journal</code> / <code>sl undo</code>：所有操作可回看、可撤销</li>
              <li>EdenFS（按需检出）与 Mononoke（服务端）代码已并入本仓库统一开发</li>
              <li>最新 0.2.20260929，持续活跃</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://github.com/facebook/sapling" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/facebook/sapling</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <line class="edge" x1="50" y1="95" x2="250" y2="95"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="70" cy="95" r="9"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="120" cy="95" r="9"/>
              <circle class="n sl-undo" cx="170" cy="95" r="9" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#dc2626"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="220" cy="95" r="9" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#16a34a"/>
              <text class="sub" x="70" y="115" text-anchor="middle">c1</text>
              <text class="sub" x="120" y="115" text-anchor="middle">c2</text>
              <text class="sub sl-undo" x="170" y="115" text-anchor="middle" fill="#dc2626">误操作</text>
              <text class="sub" x="220" y="115" text-anchor="middle" fill="#16a34a">undo</text>
              <text class="lbl" x="150" y="30" text-anchor="middle">sl undo：一切皆可回滚</text>
              <path class="edge" d="M170 78 Q195 55 220 78" fill="none" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：操作日志 + 一键撤销</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Lit -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">3</span>Lit<span class="badge oss">AGPL-3.0 + 商业双许可</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">"AI Agent 优先，人类其次"的 Git 替代品（Rust）</p>
            <ul>
              <li>默认 <b>JSON 输出</b>、内置 30 个 MCP 工具，专为 Agent 调用设计</li>
              <li>"改动原因"是结构化元数据字段，不再是自由文本</li>
              <li>甚至内置后量子加密（ML-DSA-87）；最新 1.8.0，极早期</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://github.com/nervosys/Lit" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/nervosys/Lit</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <div style="background:#0f172a;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;">
              <div class="lit-line">$ lit commit --json</div>
              <div class="lit-line" style="animation-delay:.6s">&#123; "change": "k7x2",</div>
              <div class="lit-line" style="animation-delay:1.2s">&nbsp;&nbsp;"why": "fix auth race",</div>
              <div class="lit-line" style="animation-delay:1.8s">&nbsp;&nbsp;"agent": "claude-4" &#125;</div>
            </div>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：结构化输出，Agent 原生可读</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Fossil -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">4</span>Fossil<span class="badge oss">BSD-2-Clause · 开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">一个可执行文件装下整个研发协作平台</p>
            <ul>
              <li>版本控制 + Bug 追踪 + Wiki + 论坛，开箱即用</li>
              <li><code>blame</code> / <code>praise</code> 逐行追溯；SQLite 团队自用</li>
              <li>最新 2.28（2026-03）——不会取代 Git，但会一直在</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://www.fossil-scm.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fossil-scm.org</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <rect class="fs-box" x="70" y="18" width="160" height="86" rx="12" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="150" y="40" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">fossil（单文件）</text>
              <text class="sub" x="96" y="64">VCS</text>
              <text class="sub" x="140" y="64">Wiki</text>
              <text class="sub" x="184" y="64">Tickets</text>
              <text class="sub" x="110" y="86">Forum</text>
              <text class="sub" x="168" y="86">Chat</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：一体化，零依赖自托管</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Mercurial -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">5</span>Mercurial<span class="badge oss">GPL-2.0+ · 开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">优雅的经典 DVCS——"更好的设计未必赢"的样本</p>
            <ul>
              <li>命令简洁、心智模型干净，比 Git 易学</li>
              <li>仍在维护（7.2.4，2026-05 有稳定版），Rust 化推进中</li>
              <li>生态收缩是事实，接替 Git 的可能性已很低</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://www.mercurial-scm.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mercurial-scm.org</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <path class="hg-line" d="M40 90 Q90 90 100 60 T160 35 T260 35" fill="none" stroke="#0d9488" stroke-width="2"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="40" cy="90" r="8"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="100" cy="60" r="8"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="160" cy="35" r="8"/>
              <circle class="n" cx="220" cy="35" r="8" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#0d9488"/>
              <text class="sub" x="150" y="110" text-anchor="middle">hg log：干净的直线历史</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：简洁一致的心智模型</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Pijul -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">6</span>Pijul<span class="badge oss">GPL / AGPL · 开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">基于补丁理论：合并有数学上的正确性保证</p>
            <ul>
              <li>补丁可交换顺序（commutation），合并结果与顺序无关</li>
              <li>2023 年发过 1.0，因内核重写回到 1.0.0-beta——理论优雅，工程缓慢</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://pijul.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pijul.org</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <g class="pj-a"><rect x="40" y="30" width="70" height="26" rx="6" fill="#ede9fe" stroke="#7c3aed"/><text class="lbl" x="75" y="47" text-anchor="middle">补丁 A</text></g>
              <g class="pj-b"><rect x="190" y="30" width="70" height="26" rx="6" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#d97706"/><text class="lbl" x="225" y="47" text-anchor="middle">补丁 B</text></g>
              <line class="edge" x1="150" y1="62" x2="150" y2="78"/>
              <rect x="110" y="80" width="80" height="26" rx="6" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#16a34a"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="150" y="97" text-anchor="middle">结果相同 ✓</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：A∘B = B∘A，交换无关</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ B 组 ============ -->
      <section class="group">
        <div class="group-title"><h2>B · 非完全开源，个人免费用</h2><span>能用，但规则在别人手里</span></div>
        <p class="group-desc">功能成熟、个人免费，代价是许可证或平台依赖。</p>

        <!-- 7. GitButler -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">7</span>GitButler<span class="badge fair">FSL · 两年后转 Apache-2.0</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">虚拟分支：多条分支的改动同时作用于一个工作区</p>
            <ul>
              <li>改动随时改派归属分支，自动记录状态</li>
              <li>FSL 不是严格开源，但属"延迟开源"，个人完全免费</li>
              <li>2026 年活跃开发中</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://github.com/gitbutlerapp/gitbutler" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/gitbutlerapp/gitbutler</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <g class="gb-lane"><rect x="40" y="18" width="90" height="24" rx="6" fill="#dbeafe" stroke="#2563eb"/><text class="lbl" x="85" y="34" text-anchor="middle">分支 A 改动</text></g>
              <g class="gb-lane" style="animation-delay:.8s"><rect x="170" y="18" width="90" height="24" rx="6" fill="#ede9fe" stroke="#7c3aed"/><text class="lbl" x="215" y="34" text-anchor="middle">分支 B 改动</text></g>
              <rect x="70" y="76" width="160" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="150" y="95" text-anchor="middle">同一个工作区</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：虚拟分支并行落在同一工作区</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Graphite -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">8</span>Graphite<span class="badge fair">闭源 SaaS · 有免费额度</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">stacked PR 工作流 → 现已成为 Cursor 的 AI 审查平台</p>
            <ul>
              <li>把大改动拆成一串相互依赖的小 PR，逐层审查合并</li>
              <li><b>2025-12 被 Cursor（Anysphere）收购</b>，转型 AI 代码审查</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://graphite.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">graphite.dev</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <rect class="n gr-p1" x="105" y="84" width="90" height="24" rx="6"/><text class="lbl" x="150" y="100" text-anchor="middle">PR 1 基础</text>
              <rect class="n gr-p2" x="105" y="50" width="90" height="24" rx="6" fill="#dbeafe"/><text class="lbl" x="150" y="66" text-anchor="middle">PR 2 功能</text>
              <rect class="n gr-p3" x="105" y="16" width="90" height="24" rx="6" fill="#ede9fe"/><text class="lbl" x="150" y="32" text-anchor="middle">PR 3 收尾</text>
              <text class="sub" x="215" y="100">先合并</text>
              <text class="sub" x="215" y="32">后合并</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：叠放 PR，逐层依赖</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Delta -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">9</span>Delta / DeltaDB<span class="badge fair">闭源 · 邀请制 Beta</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">Zed 出品：记录每次操作，代码与对话双向追溯</p>
            <ul>
              <li>操作流而非快照：每次编辑有稳定身份与锚点</li>
              <li>从代码反查产生它的 Agent 对话；与 Git 共存，队友无感</li>
              <li>独立 beta 应用（排队中），未来并入 Zed</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://zed.dev/blog/introducing-delta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">zed.dev/blog/introducing-delta</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <rect x="20" y="20" width="110" height="34" rx="8" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#0d9488"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="75" y="35" text-anchor="middle">Agent 对话</text>
              <text class="sub" x="75" y="48" text-anchor="middle">"为什么这样改"</text>
              <rect x="170" y="20" width="110" height="34" rx="8" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="225" y="35" text-anchor="middle">代码行</text>
              <text class="sub" x="225" y="48" text-anchor="middle">@锚点 d-417</text>
              <line class="dl-link" x1="130" y1="37" x2="170" y2="37" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text class="sub" x="150" y="100" text-anchor="middle">双向跳转，永不断链</text>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：锚点连接代码与对话</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ C 组 ============ -->
      <section class="group">
        <div class="group-title"><h2>C · 大厂内部系统 × 开源平替</h2><span>拿不到原版，但有复刻可上手</span></div>
        <p class="group-desc">左边是论文与博客里的传说，右边是社区的可运行实现。</p>

        <!-- 10. Piper × Mega -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">C1</span>Piper + CitC × Mega<span class="badge closed">Piper 闭源</span> <span class="badge oss">Mega 开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">Google 的 86TB 单仓库，以及它的开源复刻</p>
            <ul>
              <li><b>Piper</b>：只存在于 CACM 2016 论文（DOI 10.1145/2854146）；CitC 云端工作区，本地零检出</li>
              <li><b>Mega</b>：Rust 实现、Git 协议兼容、536 star、3900+ 提交，活跃但无正式 release；配套 Libra（Agent 客户端）、Scorpio（FUSE 挂载）</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://github.com/web3infra-foundation/mega" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/web3infra-foundation/mega</a></p>
            <div class="pair">注意：Mega 集成的构建系统 Buck2 是 Meta 出品，并非其自研。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <ellipse cx="150" cy="34" rx="46" ry="18" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text class="lbl" x="150" y="38" text-anchor="middle">云端 Monorepo</text>
              <g class="pp-c1"><rect x="30" y="76" width="56" height="26" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#94a3b8"/><text class="sub" x="58" y="93" text-anchor="middle">浏览器</text></g>
              <g class="pp-c2"><rect x="122" y="76" width="56" height="26" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#94a3b8"/><text class="sub" x="150" y="93" text-anchor="middle">云桌面</text></g>
              <g class="pp-c3"><rect x="214" y="76" width="56" height="26" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#94a3b8"/><text class="sub" x="242" y="93" text-anchor="middle">CLI</text></g>
              <line class="edge" x1="58" y1="76" x2="120" y2="46"/><line class="edge" x1="150" y1="76" x2="150" y2="52"/><line class="edge" x1="242" y1="76" x2="180" y2="46"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="cap">核心概念：CitC——不克隆，云端叠加修改</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 11. Scion × OpenScion -->
        <div class="card">
          <div>
            <h3><span class="rank">C2</span>Scion × OpenScion 复刻<span class="badge closed">Scion 不对外发布</span> <span class="badge oss">复刻开源</span></h3>
            <p class="tagline">Anthropic 的服务端版本控制，以及三个社区实现</p>
            <ul>
              <li><b>Scion</b>：7 人团队 5 个月建成；changeset + WAL、Spanner CAS 无锁合并、派生数据、三层缓存；官方明说"绝非 Git 的通用替代品"</li>
              <li><b>平替</b>：tinyhumansai/openscion（Rust，GPL-3.0）、CarterT27/scion（Rust clean-room，Apache-2.0）、feder-cr/open_scion（已改名 git-ai，Go）——都是刚起步的小项目</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="link">→ <a href="https://github.com/tinyhumansai/openscion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">openscion</a> · <a href="https://github.com/CarterT27/scion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CarterT27/scion</a> · <a href="https://github.com/feder-cr/open_scion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">git-ai</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="demo">
            <svg width="300" height="120" viewBox="0 0 300 120">
              <g class="sc-cs"><rect x="110" y="14" width="80" height="24" rx="6" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#d97706"/><text class="lbl" x="150" y="30" text-anchor="middle">changeset</text></g>
              <rect x="60" y="72" width="180" height="34" rx="8" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="1.5"/>
